 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Elastic collisions",
   "text": "In an **elastic** collision momentum **and** kinetic energy are conserved. Four special cases follow from \\( v_1 \\) and \\( v_2 \\) of the general formulas.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 4,
      "m2": 4,
      "u1": 6,
      "u2": 2,
      "lv": 0,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Equal masses swap velocities",
   "text": "\\( m_1 = m_2 \\): \\( v_1 = u_2 \\) and \\( v_2 = u_1 \\). Here 6 m s⁻¹ and 2 m s⁻¹ simply exchange: \\( v_1 = {{v1e|0}} \\), \\( v_2 = {{v2e|0}} \\).",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 4,
      "m2": 4,
      "u1": 6,
      "u2": 2,
      "lv": 1,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Target at rest",
   "text": "\\( m_1 = m_2 \\), \\( u_2 = 0 \\): the first body **stops** and the second moves off with \\( u_1 \\). (Newton’s cradle.)",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 4,
      "m2": 4,
      "u1": 6,
      "u2": 0,
      "lv": 2,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Light hits heavy",
   "text": "\\( m_2 \\gg m_1 \\), \\( u_2 = 0 \\): \\( v_1 \\approx -u_1 \\) and \\( v_2 \\approx 0 \\). The light body **bounces back** at nearly the same speed; the heavy body hardly moves (a ball hitting a wall).",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 1,
      "m2": 10,
      "u1": 8,
      "u2": 0,
      "lv": 3,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "Heavy hits light",
   "text": "\\( m_1 \\gg m_2 \\), \\( u_2 = 0 \\): \\( v_1 \\approx u_1 \\) and \\( v_2 \\approx 2u_1 \\). The heavy body barely slows; the light body shoots off at **about twice** the speed.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "m1": 10,
      "m2": 1,
      "u1": 6,
      "u2": 0,
      "lv": 4,
      "pr": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "pr": 2
     },
     "at": 200,
     "dur": 4200
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "readouts": [
  {
   "label": "v₁",
   "value": "{{v1e|2}} m/s",
   "role": "m1"
  },
  {
   "label": "v₂",
